(C) if TV(Phi') <= C0*k*spread uniformly, then R_grid_abs <= C0*k*spread/(12 Vmax^2);
    for hard clusters spread<=Vmax => R_grid_abs <= C0*k/(12 Vmax) -> a-priori Vmax0.
SOUND must be True everywhere (never claims GP when none exists -- esp. tight AP small V).
